	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"bc19c5bbf37cc9ec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [The Plan - Productivity](ThePlan.canvas)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-480,
			"y":-740,
			"width":465,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"a8946358436bba81",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Waste/Context switch",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-860,
			"y":-300,
			"width":380,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"3b2b85febeff52ba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Offload",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-340,
			"y":-300,
			"width":200,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"13c6e8c6939486ac",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Don't go to eat/rest when shit gets hard. Solve it, or at the very least create a plan on how to approach the thing after you come back.\n\t- Otherwise it'll be easier to get overwhelmed and avoid",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-90,
			"y":-190,
			"width":460,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"4bef8c218acfcf3a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Efficiency",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":20,
			"y":-300,
			"width":240,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"e6fd67927260bce0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Proved to work\n- **Cleaning**, I clean for an hour(after 1hr dream analysis), and cognitively I absolutely can do the work. ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-900,
			"y":-190,
			"width":460,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"853631ae86415cfb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```base\nfilters:\n  and:\n    - 'file.inFolder(\"ThePlan/Job-Career-Finances/Productivity/_reflections\")'\nviews:\n  - type: list\n    name: Reflections\n    order:\n      - file.name\n    sort:\n      - property: file.mtime\n        direction: DESC\n\n```\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-1115,
			"y":-740,
			"width":420,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"1e475343ed75b131",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Reflections",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1070,
			"y":-820,
			"width":330,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"38e2eba4a9f51186",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Schedule",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":"center",
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":-610,
			"y":-1255,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"9f13f060efc35264",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Time for cleaning?\n- After wake up usually a bit makes me mad/exhausted from vacuuming\n- Maybe after food? To allow to tapper-off from videos and food relaxation? ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-718,
			"y":-1065,
			"width":557,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"1259a6de4f2871b8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Discipline\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":"center",
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":348,
			"y":-1065,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"2de50086b7b3ea99",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Slavery issue\n- I'm afraid that being disciplined will suck out the spirit of creativity. But it's the opposite, masters of their craft are highly disciplined\n- Discipline gives freedom - you don't need to wait for the right mood, you don't need to avoid and torture yourself. You just start when you need to start, and fun and enjoyment comes automatically to you. ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":240,
			"y":-875,
			"width":557,
			"height":310
		},
		{
			"id":"196996a6494cb088",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Cognitive load",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":"center",
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":-410,
			"y":-520,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"b1a6275794fe563c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Pacing\nYou can pace for 15-20 minutes to get started and then inertia moves through creativity without back pain or sweating",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":540,
			"y":-380,
			"width":380,
			"height":160
		}
	],
